  entryType: 0
  missionId: 
  missionTitle: The Hungry Kitchen
  tasks: []
  openingText: "Phlox's note (opening)\n\r\n\u201CThe sunny rooms are the easiest
    to love. The light comes in properly here, even through the dirty glass. There's
    a fireplace in the room with beds that smells like old bread and smoke. There
    is something in there.\u201D\r\n"
  completionText: "Phlox's note (closing)\n\r\n\u201CIt opened its mouth for me.
    I really thought it was going to bite. There was a stone inside instead, warm
    as a windowsill. I wanted to keep it. I didn't, though. I think it belongs to
    the tree.\u201D\r\n"
  trackable: 1
  loreText: 
